        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DK854, Imperial Door Knocker</b>\r\n<p>\r\nKnown as the Imperial Door Knocker, it will help any home make a grand impression from the minute your guests arrive at your front door. The unique shape is a lovely expression of tasteful elegance. The Deltana Imperial Style Door Knocker is made of solid brass and available in 10 great finishes, including distressed oil rubbed bronze, that are highly resistant to tarnishing and corrosion.\r\n</p>\r\n<table width=\"292\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DK854-Specificaions.gif?v=1704354723\" width=\"292\" height=\"256\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DK854 Imperial Door Knocker Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n It is thru-bolt mounted with 5\" center to center mounting holes (distance between the 2 mounting screw holes). Easy to install on doors up to 2-1/2\" thick. Includes 9/16\" diameter screw bezels to cover pre-existing holes up to 1/2\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DK854 Imperial Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 5\" c.c. (distance between the 2 mounting screws)</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #8-32 x 2-7/8\" machine screws</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Thru-Bolted (screws go thru the door)</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DK854.pdf?v=1704262194\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DK854 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
